    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0576" n="472" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg472"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.00/326.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 16, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Bombardment of Esmeraldas is threatened. Presence of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Buffalo</hi> would prevent unnecessary destruction of life and property. I
                    again recommend that it proceed to that port.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
